on this demo real?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq17671" hidden><p>No. This frontend preview uses illustrative product titles, images and PKR prices to demonstrate browsing. They are not live product data, and the prices must not be treated as current store prices.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq22622">Can I order online or check out?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq22622" hidden><p>Not in this demo. It is catalogue-first and includes no cart, checkout, payment, delivery or customer-order workflow. Visitors can use the store directory to confirm availability.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Store locations</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq27830">How can I find a store?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq27830" hidden><p>Use the Find a Store page to browse currently active outlet records by city and area. City map markers show the city-centre coordinates set in the admin panel; use the outlet card for branch-specific directions.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq32601">How many branches are listed?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq32601" hidden><p>The directory shows the active branches and cities currently published by the admin team. Counts change when outlets or cities are added, updated or made inactive.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq36972">Why should I call before travelling to the warehouse?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq36972" hidden><p>Check the outlet card for the saved address, contact number and directions link. If branch-specific details are incomplete, confirm the location with the team before travelling.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Franchise and sourcing</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq42650">How can I ask about a franchise?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq42650" hidden><p>Visit the Franchise page to review the published support areas and use the contact details to speak with the team. The on-page form in this demo does not send submissions.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq47191">What investment is required?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq47191" hidden><p>The public website says figures depend on city, shop size and opening inventory. Ask Pound Store for current approved figures; this demo does not provide an investment guarantee.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq51762">What support does the company describe?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq51762" hidden><p>Its public franchise information lists direct import pricing, central warehouse supply, setup and training, marketing/branding and territory arrangements.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq56203">How does sourcing work?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq56203" hidden><p>The company describes four stages: direct import, quality control, warehousing and distribution.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Contact and demo behaviour</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq60600">How can I contact Pound Store?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq60600" hidden><p>The public website lists 0347 0006050 and poundstorewarehouse@gmail.com, with a written contact/warehouse address of Alipur Chowk, Gujranwala.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq64831">Do the enquiry forms send messages?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq64831" hidden><p>No. Forms only validate the fields locally and display a clear demo notice. They do not send emails, call an API or save data.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
